<title>EGYPT: Egyptian overnight rates still steady.</title>
<headline>Egyptian overnight rates still steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound were unchanged on Tuesday with bankers still quoting rates of about 10 and 10 1/8 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates were also steady at between 10 and 10 1/4, the bankers added.</p>
<p>But they said that public-sector banks kept their minimum lending rate at 10 1/2 percent. Earlier this week they were willing to offer lower rates.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
</text>
